<title>UK: NatWest leads 100 mln stg bond for Care Homes No 1.</title>
<headline>NatWest leads 100 mln stg bond for Care Homes No 1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Care Homes No 1 Ltd has issued a two-tranche collateralised bond for a total of 100 million stg, lead manager NatWest Markets said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The notes are collateralised by leases on nursing home properties.</p>
<p>Full details follow.</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p>TRANCHE A1</p>
<p> AMT    60 MLN STG    COUPON     **	  MATURITY	.APR.21</p>
<p> D&amp;P RATING AAA	 ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    09.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+60 BP</p>
<p>TRANCHE A2</p>
<p> AMT    40 MLN STG    COUPON     **	  MATURITY	.APR.21</p>
<p> D&amp;P RATING BBB	 ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    09.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+115 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT GILT DUE 2021</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
